<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-053-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Fig. 387: Dimorphodon -> Pteranodon skull coordinate transformation — MorphoEval overall 74.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-31"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2: dense-outline Procrustes (128-pt resample), IoU/chamfer/r/RMSE, 24-setting sweep, shuffled-landmark null (p≈0.80), specimen Otsu CV on YPM1177 photo, Jacobian min det -15.3 (grid folds). TPS Procrustes 0.726 vs similarity 0.663 vs affine 0.625 at default n_semi=20; coarse n_semi=8 TPS beats similarity slightly. Verdict mixed (high r=0.977, IoU=0.51). Foth Dryad clade frame file blocked (401). Overall 74.1/100 (faithfulness 70.7, reproducibility 81.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 35d30f4cf; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 72, Morphological realism / specimen match 68, Parameter expressivity 70, Morphometric validation 74, Source and data traceability 88, Code-to-model traceability 80, Reproducibility package 78. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_053_on_the_theory_of_transformatio_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-053_on-the-theory-of-transformations.py at 35d30f4cf, image/png, 135226 B, 2100×750 px, artifact_sha256 8826b70c2a275dab8b278f48c05f8544842a65ef34016c8aafdd3f0a9a0f5285 (sha256 8826b70c2a275dab8b278f48c05f8544842a65ef34016c8aafdd3f0a9a0f5285), spec_fingerprint 2f185f72ad54c895b5a22263bae433c97f4c9067a6ce1e7845bfc5bc0a745ff5. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 2f185f72ad54c895b5a22263bae433c97f4c9067a6ce1e7845bfc5bc0a745ff5; artifact_sha256: 8826b70c2a275dab8b278f48c05f8544842a65ef34016c8aafdd3f0a9a0f5285; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-053/dryad_4nr4cf37_metadata.json=2b2c64fd9aacd5b1..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-053/nie1905_dimorphodon_pteranodon_comparison.png=18604cc23a3c7635..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-053/ongrowthform1917thom_p756_leaf0775_fig387.jpg=faf3c2cff141abad..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-053/pteranodon_longiceps_ypm1177_vendored.jpg=5f3272484ee1b584..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-053/t1917_053_on_the_theory_of_transformatio_reference.json=9e1babca8eff80e8...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-31-t1917-053-on-the-theory-of-